  "prefLabel": "Plc 403.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 403.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish procedures and requirements that apply to any of the inspection types covered in Plc 404 through Plc 406.\n\nSource. #14031, eff 8-15-24",
